The '''thirteenth series''' of ''[[The Great British Bake Off]]'' began on 13 September 2022.<ref>{{cite news |date=1 September 2022 |title=The Great British Bake Off returning on September 13 |work=[[Heart (radio network)|Heart]] |url=https://heart.co.uk/showbiz/tv-movies/great-british-bake-off/2022-return-date-announced-september/ |url-status=live |access-date=7 September 2022 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20220902124717/https://www.heart.co.uk/showbiz/tv-movies/great-british-bake-off/2022-return-date-announced-september/ |archive-date=2 September 2022}}</ref> It is again presented by [[Noel Fielding]] and [[Matt Lucas]] and judged by [[Paul Hollywood]] and [[Prue Leith]].<ref>{{cite news |date=7 September 2022 |title=Great British Bake Off 2022 start date confirmed by Channel 4 |work=[[Radio Times]] |url=https://www.radiotimes.com/tv/entertainment/great-british-bake-off-2022-start-date-confirmed-newsupdate/ |url-status=live |access-date=7 September 2022 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20220901085800/https://www.radiotimes.com/tv/entertainment/great-british-bake-off-2022-start-date-confirmed-newsupdate/ |archive-date=1 September 2022}}</ref> The bakers competing in the series were announced on 2 September 2022.<ref>{{cite news |date=4 September 2022 |title=Great British Bake Off 2022: Meet this year's bakers |work=[[BBC News]] |url=https://www.bbc.co.uk/newsround/62786542 |url-status=live |access-date=7 September 2022 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20220906162901/https://www.bbc.co.uk/newsround/62786542 |archive-date=6 September 2022}}</ref><ref>{{cite news |date=5 September 2022 |title=Great British Bake Off 2022: Meet the new contestants |work=[[Digital Spy]] |url=https://www.digitalspy.com/tv/reality-tv/g41084533/great-british-bake-off-2022-new-contestants/ |url-status=live |access-date=7 September 2022 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20220906151028/https://www.digitalspy.com/tv/reality-tv/g41084533/great-british-bake-off-2022-new-contestants/ |archive-date=6 September 2022}}</ref> The series was filmed at [[Welford Park]], an estate near [[Newbury, Berkshire|Newbury]], [[Berkshire]] which was previously used for the programme from 2014 to 2019.<ref>{{Cite web |title=Where is the Great British Bake Off filmed? |url=https://www.thetimes.com/travel/inspiration/where-is-the-great-british-bake-off-filmed-bns860zx2 |website=[[The Times]] |date=13 September 2022 }}</ref>

The season was won by Syabira Yusoff, with Abdul Rehman Sharif and Nelsandro "Sandro" Farmhouse finishing as the runners-up. Yusoff is the first female winner since Sophie Faldo from Season 8.<ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.theguardian.com/tv-and-radio/live/2022/nov/15/the-great-british-bake-off-2022-final-live|title=The Great British Bake Off 2022 final – as it happened|date=15 November 2022|work=Guardian|accessdate=16 November 2022}}</ref><ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.digitalspy.com/tv/reality-tv/a41970742/great-british-bake-off-winner-2022-series/|title=Great British Bake Off reveals winner for 2022 series|date=15 November 2022|work=Digital Spy|accessdate=16 November 2022}}</ref>

This was the final series presented by Matt Lucas, who announced his departure from the programme on 6 December 2022.

