=== Episode 3: Bread ===
The bakers were set the task of making two sharing-size [[pizza]]s in two hours for the signature challenge. The technical challenge, set by Paul, was the baking of twelve [[pain aux raisins]], to be completed in two hours and forty-five minutes. Finally, for their {{frac|4|1|2}}-hour showstopper, the bakers were asked to create their own interpretation of a Swedish celebration 'cake', the [[Smörgåstårta]], topped with exquisite decorations.

