=== Episode 4: Mexican ===
For their signature challenge, the bakers were asked to make twelve individual [[Pan dulce]] ("sweet bread" pastries) in {{frac|2|1|2}} hours. Paul's technical challenge required them to make eight Mexican hand-pressed corn [[tacos]] and their fillings, in two hours. The showstopper gave them four hours to make their own four-layer version of a [[Tres Leches Cake]] ('three-milk cake', a sponge cake soaked in three kinds of milk).

